GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "6F6928D56E02A352"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{A8CA841EA4E34DB5}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "The Brown Suited Bashers and the Grey Suited Grapplers have agreed to meet at the secluded Bohemian Lodge in an attempt to end their long-running feud. After years of bloodshed and backroom deals, both sides are ready to talk peace."\
     ""\
     "But not everyone wants the war to end."\
     "Certain corrupt federal agents have profited from the rivalry and intend to ensure negotiations collapse before any agreement can be made."\
     "At Bohemian Lodge, alliances will be tested — and peace may prove more dangerous than war."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
     "• SLOT BOTH MOB BOSSES - Mission critical roles."\
     "• Setup timer: 1min - Blufor."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1CF7353F1D4B88B3}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 22/03/1945, 2200hr, Manitowish Waters, Wisconsin"\
     "Weather: Clear and dry with no forecast of change. Sightlines 1km+"\
     "Terrain: Multiple shallow fords located throughout the river marked with yellow, patchey open fields tyically with deep running ditches alongside and dense woodblock with scattered treelines, many dotted hamlets and towns throughout."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "In post-war America, two rival outfits — the Brown Suited Bashers and the Grey Suited Grapplers — have agreed to meet and settle their differences. The sit-down is scheduled at a secluded retreat known as Bohemian Lodge, far from prying eyes and city streets soaked in turf wars."\
     "But peace does not serve everyone."\
     "Certain corrupt federal agents have their own interests in keeping the conflict alive. A truce would disrupt their leverage, their influence, and the profits drawn from a divided underworld."\
     "As both crews arrive expecting negotiation, unseen forces prepare to intervene."\
     "Will peace be brokered or will the feds ensure the war continues?"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Federal"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{41BC350F8A89BC3A}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 22/03/1945, 2200hr, Manitowish Waters, Wisconsin"\
     "Weather: Clear and dry with no forecast of change. Sightlines 1km+"\
     "Terrain: Multiple shallow fords located throughout the river marked with yellow, patchey open fields tyically with deep running ditches alongside and dense woodblock with scattered treelines, many dotted hamlets and towns throughout."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "In post-war America, two rival outfits — the Brown Suited Bashers and the Grey Suited Grapplers — have agreed to meet and settle their differences. The sit-down is scheduled at a secluded retreat known as Bohemian Lodge, far from prying eyes and city streets soaked in turf wars."\
     "But peace does not serve everyone."\
     "Certain corrupt federal agents have their own interests in keeping the conflict alive. A truce would disrupt their leverage, their influence, and the profits drawn from a divided underworld."\
     "As both crews arrive expecting negotiation, unseen forces prepare to intervene."\
     "Will peace be brokered or will the feds ensure the war continues?"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Mobster"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3FCF9CC721E5AA1E}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>Composition & Disposition</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of two organised crime groups, the Brown Suited Bashers and Grey Suited Grapplers. Both are well-financed, motivated, and structured criminal enterprises with influence across multiple US cities. "\
     "Intelligence obtained through an informant's dead drop indicates approximately 20 personnel are expected at the meeting location, with no civilians present. Both groups are scheduled to meet at Little Bohemian Lodge (GRID: 027010), a secluded and defensible hamlet with controlled access points, natural cover, and a river flanking the area."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Strengths & Capabilities</h2>"\
     "• Our informant reports that both mobs are well armed, carrying a range of weapons including automatic submachine guns, semi-automatic rifles, shotguns, handguns, and improvised firebombs.  "\
     "• Little Bohemian Lodge offers strong defensive potential, with high hedgerows, perimeter fencing, a flanking river, and elevated structures providing concealment, cover, and advantageous fields of fire, making it well suited for close-in defense.  "\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCO:</b> The mobs are expected to deploy sentries and conduct patrols around the compound while maintaining security and awaiting contact.  "\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCO:</b> Likely to isolate elements of our force from mutual support by fixing a callsign in position, then gradually attriting them until combat ineffective."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Federal"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6E87FE9CBEFA0DC8}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>Composition & Disposition</h2>"\
     "Unknown."\
     ""\
     "This is a high-profile meeting, it has been kept quiet and tightly controlled. We have no specific intelligence indicating an imminent attack, but we must remain prepared."\
     "Historically, our conflicts have involved the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI), U.S. Marshals, local law enforcement, and rival criminal organizations."\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCO:</b> If attacked, the enemy’s most likely course of action would be a rapid, coordinated strike from multiple directions, using superior numbers and timing to thin our ranks and defeat elements in detail."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCO:</b> Our sentries and patrols become isolated and cut off, allowing the enemy to dismantle our defenses incrementally."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Mobster"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AC75F9BF2F9B1825}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>Composition & Disposition</h2>"\
     ""\
     "<b>Composition</b>"\
     "We are the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI)."\
     "Our force consists of 28 corrupt federal officers with significant interests at stake should the mobsters succeed in making peace."\
     ""\
     "<b>Disposition</b>"\
     "Our disposition is dependent on the chosen insertion location(s)."\
     "From the staging area, we have the ability to deploy via the red or green doors to either the northern insert (GRID: 034019) or the southern insert (GRID: 022003) once the 60-second setup timer has expired."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Strengths & Capabilities</h2>"\
     "• Each insert location provides 7 unarmed civilian vehicles. The southern insert also includes 2 boats positioned on the river.  "\
     "- There is a ford between us and the objective. We can cross this with the boats if we go full speed over it. No damage taken."\
     "• We have full freedom of movement. No other hostile elements are present in the area, and the surrounding terrain is civilian in nature, aside from the lodge itself.  "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Federal"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B34A37B396BB3152}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>Composition & Disposition</h2>"\
     "We are two rival gangs, the Brown Suited Bashers and Grey Suited Grapplers, meeting to negotiate a peace agreement. Our combined strength consists of approximately 18 personnel, arriving at Little Bohemian Lodge along US Highway 51 (GRID: 027010) in unarmed civilian vehicles. "\
     ""\
     "<h2>Strengths & Capabilities</h2>"\
     "• Little Bohemian Lodge offers strong defensive potential, with high hedgerows, perimeter fencing, a flanking river, and elevated buildings providing advantageous firing positions."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Mobster"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{58DCE108D74B451E}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mission statement</h2>"\
     "Our mission is to conduct a RAID on Little Bohemia Lodge in order to DESTROY both leaders of each mob and prevent the mobs making peace. "\
     ""\
     "They won't want to hang around for long."\
     "Expect their meeting to take less then 30mins."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Execution</h2>"\
     "- Choose which insert locations we want to stage from."\
     "- Teleport to said location, mount up with haste."\
     "- Strikes hard and fast into the lodge compound."\
     "- Search and destroy the mob bosses (You'll be hinted when dead)."\
     "- Flee any direction at least 200m in a radius from the objective compound. (You'll recieve a victory prompt once enough officers have fled the distance)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Federal"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6580E2C2E023C1CD}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mission Statement</h2>"\
     "Our mission tonight is to secure peace between the mobs."\
     "We have been at war for far too long."\
     ""\
     "Both mob bosses will enter the secured large brown building (marked) to conduct negotiations. "\
     "Our divisions run deep, and it is expected to take approximately 20–25 minutes to reach an agreement (You'll recieve a hint)."\
     "The meeting won't start untill both are in the building and it'll pause if either of them leave."\
     "We should not delay. The longer we stay here the more vulnerable we are."\
     ""\
     "It is critical to mission success that both bosses remain alive long enough to finalize the deal and interact with the telephone located in the ground-floor piano room of the building where the meeting is being held. This call will signal the rest of our organizations to cease hostilities."\
     ""\
     "If EITHER boss is killed, peace will not be achievable. We've worked years to reach this moment."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Mobster"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7437A189694B6478}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>Callsigns</h2>"\
     "• Chief's team - Alpha 1"\
     "• Captain's team - Alpha 2"\
     "• 3rd team - Alpha 3"\
     "• 4th team - Alpha 4"\
     "• 5th team - Alpha 5"\
     "• 6th team - Alpha 6"\
     "• 7th team - Alpha 7"\
     ""\
     "<h2>Pyrotechnics</h2>"\
     "• White flare - Illumination"\
     "• Red flare - Begin engagement"\
     ""\
     "<h2>Passwords</h2>"\
     "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
     "• Challenge: Rose | Password: Garden"\
     "• Running password: 45"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Federal"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A0D4580547E19BF9}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>Passwords</h2>"\
     "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
     "• Challenge: Fallen | Password: Clipper"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_Mobster"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6F51B62B8250BB75}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "Mission notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>End Conditions:</h2>"\
     "<h3>BLUFOR:</h3>"\
     "<b>• Destruction victory:</b> Destroy both whole mobs (100% casualties)"\
     "<b>• Decapitation victory:</b> Kill both mob bosses + 66% of the current alive officers flee at least 200 meters in any direction from the objective compound."\
     "<b>• Pyrrhic victory:</b> Kill both mob bosses but take 90% casualties."\
     ""\
     "<h3>OPFOR:</h3> "\
     "<b>• Destruction victory:</b> Destroy 90% of Blufor + keep both bosses alive. (Thus allowing peace to be negotiated)"\
     "<b>• Peace negotiations victory:</b> Both mob bosses remain in the brown lodge building for 20-25mins and negotiate peace. Once promoted that the meeting is completed, use the phone on the ground floor in the piano room to spread the word to everyone else."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes:</h2>"\
     "• Setup timer: 1min - Blufor."\
     ""\
     "Mission made by TheLocalPub. Use the #Feedback channel on discord to provide logged mision feedback."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
